ence with status \u0060queued\u0060 or \u0060launched\u0060.\n_specs/2026-05-08 Agent Delivery Launch Evidence Enforcement.md:173:3. \u0060manual_start_required\u0060 remains visible and is not reported as automated success.\n_specs/2026-05-08 Agent Delivery Launch Evidence Enforcement.md:174:4. \u0060blocked\u0060 and \u0060failed\u0060 launch evidence block downstream delivery.\n_specs/2026-05-08 Agent Delivery Launch Evidence Enforcement.md:177:7. At least one deterministic harness or validator proves valid, missing, stale, manual, blocked, failed and semantic-only cases.\n_specs/2026-05-08 Agent Delivery Launch Evidence Enforcement.md:188:- Completeness: Pass. Normal, stale, missing, manual, blocked, failed and legacy-reconstructed paths are covered.\n_specs/2026-05-08 Agent Delivery Launch Evidence Enforcement.md:211:| \u0060dotnet run skills-repo/tools/ValidateAgentDeliveryLaunchEvidence.cs -- --fixture tests/agent-delivery-session-launcher/fixtures/launch-evidence\u0060 | ran/pass | 10 cases passed: valid queued/launched, missing, stale target, stale handoff, manual required, blocked, failed, semantic-only session id, and legacy reconstructed. |\n_specs/2026-05-08 Agent Delivery Launch Evidence Enforcement.md:212:| \u0060rg -n \u0022Agent Delivery Session Launch/Queue Evidence\\|agent-delivery-session-launches\\|manual_start_required\\|legacy_reconstructed\\|real Codex session\\|semantic.*SessionId\u0022 docs/doc-workflow.md skills-repo/skills\u0060 | ran/pass | Matches found in workflow docs and all relevant Agent Delivery skills. |\n_specs/2026-05-08 Agent Delivery Launch Evidence Enforcement.md:219:1. Matching \u0060queued\u0060 and \u0060launched\u0060 evidence passes in \u0060launch-evidence-valid-queued\u0060 and \u0060launch-evidence-valid-launched\u0060.\n_specs/2026-05-08 Agent Delivery Launch Evidence Enforcement.md:221:3. \u0060manual_start_required\u0060 returns manual residue, not automatic success, in \u0060launch-evidence-manual-required\u0060.