hared-ai-docs/skills-repo/tools/ValidateOrchestrationPack.cs\u0060\\n\\n   Zweck:\\n   Validiert Orchestration Pack, Child Index, Handoffs, Hardening Queue, Status/Next-Action-Konsistenz und falsche Final-Claims.\\n\\n   Typische Parameter:\\n   \u0060\u0060\u0060sh\\n   dotnet run /Users/dh/Documents/DanielsVault/_shared/shared-ai-docs/skills-repo/tools/ValidateOrchestrationPack.cs -- \\\\\\n     --pack /absolute/path/to/orchestration-pack.md \\\\\\n     --repo /absolute/path/to/repo \\\\\\n     --format json\\n   \u0060\u0060\u0060\\n\\n   Falls vorhanden/unterst\u00FCtzt, in der Spec anhand \u0060--help\u0060 verifizieren:\\n   - \u0060--child-index-section\u0060\\n   - \u0060--require-handoffs\u0060\\n   - \u0060--allow-extra-columns\u0060\\n   - \u0060--format json|markdown|both\u0060\\n\\n3. \u0060SyncChildHandoff.cs\u0060\\n   Pfad:\\n   \u0060/Users/dh/Documents/DanielsVault/_shared/shared-ai-docs/skills-repo/tools/SyncChildHandoff.cs\u0060\\n\\n   Zweck:\\n   Erzeugt, pr\u00FCft oder synchronisiert Child Session Handoff Dateien aus Child-Index-Zeilen und ersetzt Handoff-Template-Prosa in Skills.\\n\\n   Typische Parameter:\\n   \u0060\u0060\u0060sh\\n   dotnet run /Users/dh/Documents/DanielsVault/_shared/shared-ai-docs/skills-repo/tools/SyncChildHandoff.cs -- \\\\\\n     --index /absolute/path/to/orchestration-pack-or-child-index.md \\\\\\n     --child MD-E2E-1 \\\\\\n     --repo /absolute/path/to/repo \\\\\\n     --out /absolute/path/to/_specs/child-session-handoffs/md-e2e-1-session-handoff.md \\\\\\n     --check \\\\\\n     --format json\\n   \u0060\u0060\u0060\\n\\n   Weitere erwartete Modi, per \u0060--help\u0060 pr\u00FCfen:\\n   - \u0060--dry-run\u0060\\n   - \u0060--write\u0060\\n   - \u0060--preserve-notes\u0060\\n   - \u0060--format json|markdown|both\u0060\\n\\n4. \u0060ValidateChildReadiness.cs\u0060\\n   Pfad:\\n   \u0060/Users/dh/Documents/DanielsVault/_shared/shared-ai-docs/skills-repo/tools/ValidateChildReadiness.cs\u0060\\n\\n   Zweck:\\n   